{"id":2742,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为精准对接毕业生就业需求，提升就业指导实效，3月31日，我院在15101H教室召开2026届毕业生就业工作推进会议。学院党委副书记李庆乐与团委书记刘莉莉老师出席会议，我院全体研究生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ML4Noanml8MzviMuzLaLmLan7MVUNCUsnz7iL47io7Q2Lm90gihFp2hmCIa0L1yZn1ysnkh2Lm6VMznkUmLbnR67LzLaMlUinRffLlV2LzfFnmGsLRr2UznFL4l4UllJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMRlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6645&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/28F7DF27E54BB39D7D1305D5D0A1AF10/F0705FA4/353AE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MoR-obMl-Pn7QRUu874U4NPozQ7olMU7nzQVLR-aL4U8oRl0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hkMShVn1ysL7nkoz9ZL8n7MRA2n7W7UN-ZLR-DU8CYM7MFnlUYU8-sLlnFL4-DLRV2gtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDMmUigtA8pUncc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6645&e=.jpg\"></p><p>会上，刘老师详细介绍了学院前期就业工作具体进展，在全面掌握学院学生就业意向与实际情况基础上结合当前整体就业形势给同学们提出了一些具体建议。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MoR7oDLNCYnzlsMulLYM7UZnm9an7CUin7QRMzLanzC8Um-0gihFp2hmCIa0oky4nSh2okh2UzUZn7MRnm98LzLiollsMmnfLRCZMRARozMFUNVRM4CDLNWFLNCPMmLJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMRlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6645&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/83EF8FA48DCCF841359E764A06848C93/BAC7662B/2F163\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MLRUoiLNCYnlnkMu7nkM49DL4CZM4-UsUNLbMmV2nlUiLRl0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRn1hkUSyDM7V7M4VkL8rkMRL8LzG8L4Q2UzQ2UzAVUmnFoz6knmWkU8WFLznfLNLDgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDMmUigtA8pUncc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6645&e=.jpg\"></p><p>李书记深入剖析当前就业形势与春招的有利时机，他强调，面对日趋激烈的就业竞争，同学们需拓宽就业视野，打破“单一地区、单一岗位”的固化思维，积极关注多领域、多行业的就业机会；此外，要注重在专业学习中提升综合能力，增强核心竞争力，在激烈竞争中赢得主动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ML4Go8M4LiLzLbMuzU4U49bLlUYUN7UDUm74MRQfozT2LN70gihFp2hmCIa0UYyZLShfLYy8L4l8nm9DU4VkUllZMRr7UmC4M4A7Lm-DnmQFo7n7nR6VnNWFL8n7ozUJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMRlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6645&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C81A34354F86C1BAE845DB6378D226F6/8DDD7EFB/3DD94\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MnzQofMzLboRNPUuz9PnmvaLR-aUlUUZLzUbnRn7LzA2nz-0gihFp2hmCIa0MShVL1y8nShRUzVfMl-4U4-bLmvsMmVkL8laM7LDLll8M4AFnRU8MzfkLRnFLlW7nl78gtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDMmUigtA8pUncc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6645&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MMz9oDo77sMRWkMu8LDUzCZnN-8Um-UaLlrkozTfMmGDMzv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysLYh7M1y8MNL8oRlZL7UsLmviUNlDoR7YLzLsnmV2oRMFL4vDM7CsLzWFozvaMSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMRlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6645&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C73D646C48580D7275BE6812137F1F83/3764F712/9705\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 1px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MMz9oDo77sMRWkMu8LDUzCZnN-8Um-UaLlrkozTfMmGDMzv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysLYh7M1y8MNL8oRlZL7UsLmviUNlDoR7YLzLsnmV2oRMFL4vDM7CsLzWFozvaMSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMRlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6645&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>此次推进会为毕业生厘清就业思路与明确努力方向提供了有益指导，学院将持续聚焦毕业生就业需求，不断优化就业服务体系，助力同学们在职业发展道路上稳步前行。<br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ML4Noanml8MzviMuzLaLmLan7MVUNCUsnz7iL47io7Q2Lm90gihFp2hmCIa0L1yZn1ysnkh2Lm6VMznkUmLbnR67LzLaMlUinRffLlV2LzfFnmGsLRr2UznFL4l4UllJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMRlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6645&e=.jpg"}